Source: ros-evl-demo
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ${MAINTAINER}
Build-Depends: ${DEBIAN_BUILD_DEPENDS}
Standards-Version: 4.7.4

Package: ros-evl-demo
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libevl, ros-${ROS_DISTRO}-rcl
Description: EVL real-time + ROS 2 bridge demo
 Single Rust binary demonstrating bidirectional communication between
 an EVL real-time thread (SCHED_FIFO, 1kHz periodic timer) and ROS 2
 topics via a private cross-buffer (xbuf). The RT thread generates a
 sine wave and publishes to /rt/sensor; a subscription on /rt/command
 controls the sine amplitude.
